OL,3,GNEWSAWidow urges men to get tested for
OL,4,Aprostate cancer
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman whose husband died from
OL,7,Fprostate cancer despite initially
OL,8,Fshowing no obvious symptoms has urged
OL,9,Fmen to get tested.
OL,11,FPeter Bowler, from Stone,
OL,12,FStaffordshire, was diagnosed in early
OL,13,F2018 after his daughter noticed he
OL,14,Fseemed "a bit miserable" while they
OL,15,Fwere out shopping.
OL,17,FHe died in 2025, aged 66, but during
OL,18,Fthe seven years he was being treated,
OL,19,Fhe helped to set up free screening
OL,20,Fevents for men aged over 40.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,359,350,200,160,0,100
