OL,3,GNEWSAWidow urges men to get tested for
OL,4,Aprostate cancer
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe next event, organised by
OL,7,FStoke-on-Trent Lions Club and Burslem
OL,8,FRotary, will take place later in
OL,9,FSeptember and his widow Karen Bowler
OL,10,Fhas urged people to take advantage.
